38 Section 1. Section 53H-4-703 is amended to read:
39 53H-4-703. Federalism-related duties of Center for Constitutional Studies -- Trademark.
41 (1) In consultation with the commission and subject to appropriations by the Legislature, the center
shall:
43 [(1)] (a) develop a nonpartisan continuing education and training program for state and local
government employees on:
45 [(a)] (i) the principles of federalism;
46 [(b)] (ii) the sovereignty, supremacy, and general jurisdiction of the individual states, including the
breadth and extent of state police power jurisdiction;
48 [(c)] (iii) the history and practical implementation of the Ninth, Tenth, and Fourteenth Amendments to
the United States Constitution;
